docker run -p 6333:6333 -p 6334:6334 \
  -e QDRANT__SERVICE__API_KEY=your-secret-key-here \
  qdrant/qdrant


Qdarant colleciton is like table in relational database.


-- Spring auto crrate the collecntion on startup ì innitialize-schema í enabled:
   spring:
     ai:
       vectorstore:
         qdrant:
           collection-name: my-documents
           initialize-schema: true  # auto-creates if not exists

-- manual create collection

   curl -X PUT http://localhost:6333/collections/my-documents \
     -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
     -d '{
       "vectors": {
         "size": 1536,
         "distance": "Cosine"
       }
     }'